<title>FINLAND: PONSSE SEES IMPROVING EARNINGS IN 1997.</title>
<headline>PONSSE SEES IMPROVING EARNINGS IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest harvester maker Ponsse Oy said on Monday it expected earnings to improve this year and net sales to rise to over 400 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Net sales are expected to rise to over 400 million markka and earnings to improve,&quot; Ponsse said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>Last year, Ponsse's net sales amounted to 372.5 million markka, up from 313.7 million in 1995, but profit before extraordinary items and tax fell to 36.8 million markka from 56.8 million.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
